    <!-- COURSE 1 -->
    <section class="band" aria-labelledby="course1-title">
      <div class="band__inner">
        <h2 id="course1-title" class="display display--sm">Storytelling for B2B Sales Success</h2>
        <div>
          <div class="prose">
            <p>The power of storytelling extends far beyond entertainment&mdash;it's a vital tool for success in sales. This course integrates storytelling principles directly into your sales framework, so they become indispensable to how you sell.</p>
          </div>
          <dl class="ledger" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">
            <div class="ledger__row">
              <dt class="ledger__term">1. The Power of Storytelling</dt>
              <dd class="ledger__def">Prove that storytelling works&mdash;logically and through real-world examples&mdash;and see how information recall improves dramatically when it's wrapped in a story.</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="ledger__row">
              <dt class="ledger__term">2. The Biology of Storytelling</dt>
              <dd class="ledger__def">Learn the biological effects storytelling has on the brain, and how those effects build trust between you and your audience.</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="ledger__row">
              <dt class="ledger__term">3. Crafting an IDEA Story</dt>
              <dd class="ledger__def">Explore why a story arc matters using Joseph Campbell's Monomyth model, learn Orson Scott Card's MICE framework, and craft your first IDEA story.</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="ledger__row">
              <dt class="ledger__term">4. Crafting the CHARACTER Story</dt>
              <dd class="ledger__def">Learn when and how to tell a Character story. Using your resume, CV, or LinkedIn profile, draft and refine your &ldquo;My Story.&rdquo;</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="ledger__row">
              <dt class="ledger__term">5. Crafting the EVENT Story</dt>
              <dd class="ledger__def">Learn when to use the Event story in your sales process. Using your corporate deck, draft and tell your &ldquo;Company Story.&rdquo;</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="ledger__row">
              <dt class="ledger__term">6. Rediscovering Discovery</dt>
              <dd class="ledger__def">Revisit the Discovery phase of the sales process through the lens of storytelling&mdash;rethinking how you uncover client needs and build rapport.</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="ledger__row">
              <dt class="ledger__term">7. Unlocking Trust</dt>
              <dd class="ledger__def">Bring it all together with active listening tools, so you can build trust and connect with clients more meaningfully.</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- COURSE 2 -->
    <section class="band band--sand" aria-labelledby="course2-title">
      <div class="band__inner">
        <h2 id="course2-title" class="display display--sm">Humorous Storytelling</h2>
        <div>
          <div class="prose">
            <p>Humor connects, entertains, and leaves a lasting impression. This course teaches you how to craft and deliver humor-infused narratives that captivate your audience, whether you're a seasoned storyteller or new to the stage.</p>
          </div>
          <dl class="ledger" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">
            <div class="ledger__row">
              <dt class="ledger__term">1. Introduction to Humorous Storytelling</dt>
              <dd class="ledger__def">Learn the basics of storytelling with a focus on humor, get introduced to a story framework that's a recipe for well-crafted stories, and discover the relationship between Premise and Discovery.</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="ledger__row">
              <dt class="ledger__term">2. Story Development</dt>
              <dd class="ledger__def">See how the other phases of the story framework flesh out your story, and use a template to outline your story before sharing it with others.</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="ledger__row">
              <dt class="ledger__term">3. Humor Mechanics</dt>
              <dd class="ledger__def">Explore different types of humor, how they work, how to embed them in your narrative, and how to start your story off with a bang.</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="ledger__row">
              <dt class="ledger__term">4. Timing, Pacing, and Delivery</dt>
              <dd class="ledger__def">Shift from drafting to performing&mdash;control timing, pacing, and delivery to maximize impact, and prepare for the final performance showcase.</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

