            </div>
            <div class="ledger__row">
              <dt class="ledger__term">2. Core Values as the Foundation of Your Brand</dt>
              <dd class="ledger__def">Learn why well-defined core values are essential and how they guide your actions and decisions.</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="ledger__row">
              <dt class="ledger__term">3. Defining Your Core Values</dt>
              <dd class="ledger__def">Reflect on your beliefs, priorities, and experiences to identify the values most important to you&mdash;the foundation of your personal brand.</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="ledger__row">
              <dt class="ledger__term">4. Building Your Personal Brand</dt>
